        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the entire relocation process take from Hazaribagh to Buxar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Typical transit time is 2‑3 days, depending on traffic and weather conditions along the National Highway corridors. The process includes a pre‑move survey (1 day), packing and loading (1‑2 days), highway transit (≈24 hours), and final unloading at the destination. Shree Ashirwad’s optimized routing often shortens the journey by up to 5 hours.</p>
